  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated support to vulnerable communities in Um Badah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to provide an improved inclusive WASH, food security and livelihood services, and Protection through enhancing the contribution of civil society, particularly women and youths in Nifasha block 51 Umbada locality of Khartoum State (Um Bada,). 
Project Outcome and Output:
FSL Theme: The capacity of communities to respond to livelihood shocks improved through access to essential inputs and services.
Protection theme: Improved child protection services through an effective response mechanism focusing on the most vulnerable children in targeted host communities of Om Bada Localitiy
FSL Theme Outcome 1: The capacity of communities to respond to livelihood shocks improved through access to essential inputs and services.
Protection theme: Outcome 1: Improved child protection services through an effective response mechanism focusing on the most vulnerable children in targeted host communities of Om Bada Localitiy
WASH Theme: Improved access to sanitation among targeted populations.</narrative>
  </description>
